5.11 Layer 8 – Production Deployment

Production EC2 instances should be deployed only from approved Golden AMIs.

Terraform should consume the approved AMI rather than engineers manually selecting an AMI during deployment.

Recommended Flow
Approved Golden AMI
        |
        ▼
SSM Parameter Store
        |
        ▼
Terraform
        |
        ▼
Launch Template
        |
        ▼
Auto Scaling Group
        |
        ▼
EC2

For example:

/aws/company/golden-ami/windows-2022

Terraform retrieves the approved AMI reference and uses it during deployment.

